{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224120","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1122412001:1":{"text":"Dura above! You actually found my goods!","source_cn":"艾雅在上……你们真的找回了我的货物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABB2715C9E266ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1122412002:1":{"text":"No need to act all surprised! Just check if everything's there. I want to get paid.","source_cn":"别光顾着痛哭流涕了，赶紧清点一下，我们还等着领赏金呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08999FA2A4B37282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122412003:1":{"text":"Alright, not so fast. Let me take a look first...","source_cn":"哎呀，别急，让我仔细点点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7005A0E2C6E74109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122412004:1":{"text":"Hmm... it's less than my original shipment. It's not a huge loss, but still...","source_cn":"这……这比丢失之前，少了不少好东西啊！虽然整体损失不大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF1C47A936A50032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1122412005:1":{"text":"This shipment was in the hands of the bandits for a long time. What do you expect?","source_cn":"这批货在盗匪手里待了这么久，不缺斤少两才怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2F64CD29C52D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122412006:1":{"text":"I'll say this right now. If our reward is even a single copper less than what your bounty stated, we're going to have a problem.","source_cn":"但我丑话说在前头，赏金可不能有半个金币的折扣。否则，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C52E00427D90F4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122412007:1":{"text":"Hey, I didn't mean like that! Whatever was stated on the bounty is what you're going to get.","source_cn":"——别别别！我没这意思！悬赏令上说的赏金，绝对不会少了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4851933038F19113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1122412008:1":{"text":"Alright... hurry up.","source_cn":"好吧，动作快点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD54FE8053CD0F50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1122412008":{"text":"Alright... hurry up.","source_cn":"好吧，动作快点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD54FE8053CD0F50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122412009:1":{"text":"For the sake of our base... and so you all can have a bigger cut.","source_cn":"为了基地的建设——也为了让你们多挣点酬金。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2393AE917FDFE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1122412010:1":{"text":"I mean she set the reward herself, so I'm not going to feel sorry for her.","source_cn":"更何况，是他自己定的悬赏金额，我可不会替他心疼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8251D28AF38D1F47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1122412011:1":{"text":"Here you go! Ten thousand gold!","source_cn":"给。你们检查吧，一万枚金币！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69D7D6E9D5226E2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1122412012:1":{"text":"Well, that definitely feels like ten thousand gold. Much obliged.","source_cn":"重量差不多。算你识相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08287BBA0122D033","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1122412013:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Wildclaw, let's divvy up our cuts!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x44864BFEE7E58988","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Wildclaw, let's divvy up our cuts!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Wildclaw, let's divvy up our cuts!","variant_male_record_index":"127129","variant_female_record_index":"127130","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"Uh...","source_cn":"呃……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF817428D8EC08F63","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Uh...","female":"Uh...","variant_male_record_index":"64632","variant_female_record_index":"64633","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"Why are you being so aggressive?","source_cn":"怎么突然变得咄咄逼人了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC6D0A3CEC8ED6CEB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why are you being so aggressive?","female":"Why are you being so aggressive?","variant_male_record_index":"64634","variant_female_record_index":"64635","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:红沙棘商队首领":{"text":"Buckthorn Leader","source":"红沙棘商队首领","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:银喙":{"text":"Silverbeak","source":"银喙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}